msgctxt "3748"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san, do you, like, go out to these kind of clubs often?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3760"
msgid "Yeah, I'd say I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3772"
msgid ""
"Really? I just started working here, so like, I'm still kinda confused "
"about how it all works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3784"
msgid "I mean, I never thought I'd be working at a place like this, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3796"
msgid "Why'd you take the job, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3808"
msgid "Why else? I needed the money, duh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3820"
msgid "Just for the money?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3832"
msgid "Yeah! And also, I do belly dancing, so there's that, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3844"
msgid "Belly dancing? What's that like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3856"
msgid "It's a dance that's like, all about twisting and shaking your hips and butt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3868"
msgid "Shaking your butt..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3880"
msgid "Hahaha! ♪ Ohmigosh, Kiryu-san, the look on your face is just priceless!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3892"
msgid "Heh, is it, now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3904"
msgid "Well, anyway, I'm a pretty good belly dancer. I wanna go pro someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3916"
msgid "Oh, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3928"
msgid ""
"And I wanna go study abroad in Istanbul. It's basically where all the good "
"belly dancers come from, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3940"
msgid "So that's why you're working here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3952"
msgid "Yeeeep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3964"
msgid ""
"Anyway, so I was thinking about going out to the birthplace of belly "
"dancing to do some intense training, so here I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3976"
msgid "Hopefully you can make the trip there soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3988"
msgid "Yeah, but, like..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4000"
msgid ""
"Sometimes I worry about it, like, can I really survive over there on my "
"own? I mean, I'm just kind of chilling over here, not taking things too "
"seriously."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4012"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4024"
msgid ""
"Plus, I'd be sooo far away from all my friends over there, and that's kind "
"of holding me back from going, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4036"
msgid "Leaving your comfort zone is never easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4048"
msgid "Haha! I totally get that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4060"
msgid "And believe me, I've been in that situation plenty of times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4072"
msgid "All that to improve your dancing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4084"
msgid "Yup. I'm guessing you don't really know much about dancing, huh, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4096"
msgid "I don't, sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4108"
msgid "Hahaha! ♪ Ohmigosh, why are you apologizing? You're so funny!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4120"
msgid ""
"If you rolled on up in here talking about how much you loved dancing, I'd "
"be suuuper weirded out. Don't worry about it, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4132"
msgid "Heh, all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4144"
msgid "That's incredible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4156"
msgid "I wouldn't call it that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4168"
msgid "My pride's on the line!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4180"
msgid "...Could you explain that to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4192"
msgid ""
"So like, I'm a real sore loser, and I hate when people are better than me. "
"I've gotta go pro if I wanna protect my pride, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4204"
msgid "Like, I can't stop now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4216"
msgid "That makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4228"
msgid "So Kiryu-san, what do you do, like, for fun?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4240"
msgid "...Drink?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4252"
msgid "Hahaha, ohmigosh, you sounded sooo cool just now! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4264"
msgid ""
"Definitely not surprised to hear you say that, Kiryu-san. That's basically "
"the same as me, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4276"
msgid "You like to drink too, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4288"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I loooove to get drunk. I'm suuuuch a cheap date, but I don't care! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4300"
msgid "Sometimes I go way overboard, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4312"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4324"
msgid ""
"Ohmigosh, Kiryu-san! You can't just ask me that! It's suuuch an "
"embarrassing story!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4336"
msgid "Heh, if you say so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4348"
msgid ""
"So anyway, how are you the morning after you drink a ton? Do you get all "
"depressed or are you totally fine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4360"
msgid "I'm usually fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4372"
msgid "So you can drink a lot without getting, like, sick?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4384"
msgid "I don't know about that, but I've got some tolerance, sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4396"
msgid ""
"I totally feel that. I'm surprised, though, like, I totally pegged you for "
"a guy who could down a keg and feel like, nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4408"
msgid "...Don't get me too curious. I just might do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4420"
msgid "Sometimes I have a hard time getting up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4432"
msgid "Hehehe. I totally thought so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4444"
msgid ""
"There was this one time, I woke up after a crazy night, and I rolled over "
"and saw my friend passed out on the floor, with some weird piece of "
"something in her mouth..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4456"
msgid "For a second I was like, whoa, maybe I shouldn't do this again, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4468"
msgid "Heh. Crazy nights like that happen sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4480"
msgid "Morning? Try afternoon. I'm dead to the world until then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4492"
msgid "Hahaha, seriously? Ohmigosh, do you get like, blackout drunk?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4504"
msgid "I mean, I wouldn't say I've never blacked out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4516"
msgid ""
"Like, isn't it soooo funny when you're so drunk, you have nooo idea what's "
"going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4528"
msgid "...Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4540"
msgid "I would so love to see you get blackout drunk, Kiryu-san! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4552"
msgid "Heh, we'll see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4564"
msgid "Ugh, what a total buzzkill..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4576"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4588"
msgid ""
"So like, one of my customers started giving me crap about my tattoo! What "
"is he, my dad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4600"
msgid "He did? Damn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4612"
msgid ""
"I know, right? He started going on and on about \"what would my parents "
"think\" and how \"people would judge me\" and asking if I were really tough "
"enough to deal with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4624"
msgid "Why doesn't he just, like, mind his own business? Seriously!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4636"
msgid "Don't worry about him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4648"
msgid "I mean, I'm not, I'm just annoyed, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4660"
msgid "I've got a tattoo myself, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4672"
msgid "Oooh, really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4684"
msgid "It means something a whole lot different than yours, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4696"
msgid "...Is it on your back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4708"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4720"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4732"
msgid "Anyway. Getting inked is our own burden to bear, not anyone else's."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4744"
msgid ""
"You're right... They can complain all they want about it, but it's our "
"decision, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4756"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4768"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4780"
msgid ""
"I don't think I've ever met someone like you, like, ever. You're so "
"different. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4792"
msgid "You think so...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4804"
msgid "I completely agree with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4816"
msgid "Thank you! Like, just mind your own frickin' business, you old fart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4828"
msgid "...Uh-huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4840"
msgid "Ugh, he totally killed my good mood..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4852"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4864"
msgid "I think it's great you have a tattoo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4876"
msgid "Uh, what? You don't have to, like, suck up to me, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4888"
msgid "...I mean, I've got a tattoo, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4900"
msgid "Oooh, really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4912"
msgid "It means something a whole lot different than yours, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4924"
msgid "...Is it on your back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4936"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4948"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4960"
msgid "Anyway. Getting inked is our own burden to bear, not anyone else's."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4972"
msgid ""
"You're right... They can complain all they want about it, but it's our "
"decision, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4984"
msgid "That's right. Yours means something special to you, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4996"
msgid "Well, yeah, duh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5008"
msgid "Then there's no problem, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5020"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5032"
msgid ""
"I was feeling really crappy about it before, but after talking to\r\n"
"you, I feel, like, way better. ♪ Thanks for letting me vent,\r\n"
"Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5044"
msgid "Heh, no problem. Vent to me anytime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5056"
msgid "Uggghhh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5068"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5080"
msgid ""
"So these construction dudes came in earlier, and they brought their CEO "
"with them, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5092"
msgid "That guy was suuuuuch an asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5104"
msgid ""
"Like, he kept bragging on and on, \"Oh, we built this big hotel! We're "
"gonna build this apartment complex in Okinawa! You gotta buy three cars "
"before you get your dream car!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5116"
msgid "Guess you run into those kinds of guys sometimes, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5128"
msgid ""
"Ugh, I hate guys who don't know when to shut up! What, does he think he's "
"like, cool or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5140"
msgid "He's totally not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5152"
msgid ""
"Ugh, I feel bad for the losers who have to listen to him all the time. I "
"bet they didn't have enough booze to deal with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5164"
msgid "I'm way more into guys who like, don't talk all that much, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5176"
msgid "I feel that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5188"
msgid "Oh, hey, you're kind of like that, huh, Kiryu-san! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5200"
msgid "I wouldn't say that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5212"
msgid "Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> C'mon, you know I'm right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5224"
msgid "Heh, all right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5236"
msgid "Just forget about him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5248"
msgid "I guess. I mean, he's just a customer, anyway. I gotta do my job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5260"
msgid "It still really pisses me off..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5272"
msgid "Understandable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5284"
msgid "Men are proud creatures like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5296"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5308"
msgid "...So, what, do you like to brag like that too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5320"
msgid "No. I don't have anything I can brag about, really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5332"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5344"
msgid ""
"You sure about that? 'Cause, like, you seem like you've got a lot going on "
"behind the scenes, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5356"
msgid "Heh, not these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5368"
msgid ""
"So, Kiryu-san, I bet you're super into someone cooking a nice homemade meal "
"for you, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5380"
msgid "...Yeah, that sounds about right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5392"
msgid "I've, like, finally started to get good at cooking now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5404"
msgid "Oh, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5416"
msgid ""
"Yeah. My ex-boyfriend was always begging me to cook for him, so I figured "
"I'd start doing it more often."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5428"
msgid ""
"I mean, I feel like most people wanna do nice things like that for their "
"boyfriends and girlfriends, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5440"
msgid "I don't know who wouldn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5452"
msgid ""
"Right! So, like, after that, I started having a ton of fun with it. I feel "
"like I eat at home way more often than I eat out nowadays."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5464"
msgid "Do you always cook for yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5476"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. I probably don't look like the kind of girl who's, like, all "
"domestic and stuff, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5488"
msgid "Yeah, but I had a feeling you were a good cook all along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5500"
msgid ""
"Uh, what? What kind of excuse is that? Like, you know that sounds super "
"shady, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5512"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5524"
msgid ""
"I mean, it sounds like you assumed I was a crappy cook, but totally changed "
"your mind as soon as I said I was good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5536"
msgid "I... don't get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5548"
msgid "Will you make something for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5560"
msgid ""
"Huh? Ohmigosh, Kiryu-san, you can't just, like, ask me to make you food all "
"of a sudden! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5572"
msgid "Heh, sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5584"
msgid ""
"And please, I bet you say that to all the girls. You sound like you've "
"practiced that line a million times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5596"
msgid "...It's just your imagination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5608"
msgid "Yeah, no, now you're being even more shady..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5620"
msgid "Seriously, it's just your imagination..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5632"
msgid "It's good to do something nice for someone. So I think I can understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5644"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I'm like, super lazy when it comes to doing something for myself, but "
"when someone else gets involved, I'm suddenly, like, all for it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5656"
msgid "I get that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5668"
msgid "Sounds like we really think alike, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5680"
msgid "I guess we do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5692"
msgid "Hey, so like, what do you do on the weekends, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5704"
msgid "Nothing in particular, really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5716"
msgid "Huh, okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5728"
msgid "What about you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5740"
msgid ""
"Huh? Me? I mean, kinda the same? Though I like to sacrifice all my sleep to "
"squeeze out as much fun as I can get."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5752"
msgid "...You don't sleep?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5764"
msgid "Like, I do sleep... but not a whole lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5776"
msgid "Heh, to each his own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5788"
msgid ""
"There's always some birthday or some kind of occasion going on every week, "
"so we get like, forty or fifty people to go out and party hard..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5800"
msgid "I tend to avoid big groups of people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5812"
msgid "...Oh, huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5824"
msgid "I mean, I'm not that surprised. You kind of give off that vibe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5836"
msgid "I think I like a nice, quiet drink a whole lot better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5848"
msgid ""
"Mm-hmm. You know that's like, super cool, right? And it's sooo you. I like "
"it. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5860"
msgid "Still, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5872"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5884"
msgid ""
"I think you could have a totally awesome time out at a club with the right "
"crowd. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5896"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5908"
msgid ""
"Yeah! I'll bring you with me one night, you'll see! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5920"
msgid "Well... all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5932"
msgid "That's a pretty big party."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5944"
msgid ""
"I mean, sure, fifty people's pretty big, but it's always the same peeps, "
"you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5956"
msgid "Oh, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5968"
msgid "How does your body survive that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5980"
msgid "Hehehe. Sometimes, it totally doesn't..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5992"
msgid ""
"I mean, I try to drink as much water as I can when we go club hopping, but, "
"you know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6004"
msgid "Heh, sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6016"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, though, I've got, like, waaaay more tolerance now because of "
"it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6028"
msgid "That's good, at least..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6040"
msgid "Uuuuugh! I'm such an idiot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6052"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6064"
msgid "I totally forgot to buy some..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6076"
msgid "Buy some what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6088"
msgid "Huh? Oh, I was supposed to buy incense, and it totally just slipped my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6100"
msgid "Incense? What for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6112"
msgid ""
"For making my room smell good. I love incense, and, well, pretty much "
"anything that smells good, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6124"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6136"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I use white musk oil in the bath, then when I get out, I put on this "
"awesome body cream, and I always put on a little bit of perfume before I go "
"to bed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6148"
msgid "You're basically making a smell sandwich."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6160"
msgid ""
"Hahahah! Ohmigod, Kiryu-san, you're gonna make me pee my\r\n"
"pants! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6172"
msgid "...I mean, that's way too many scents on top of one another, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6184"
msgid "Huh!? No way, it's totally fine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6196"
msgid "Oh... All right, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6208"
msgid "So that's why you smell so good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6220"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6232"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6244"
msgid ""
"Uh, Kiryu-san, it's reeeeally creepy when you lean in to smell me... Could "
"you like, not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6256"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6268"
msgid "Do I smell good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6280"
msgid "Wait, what!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6292"
msgid "How do I smell?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6304"
msgid "Um, uh... Do you want me to like, sniff you, or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6316"
msgid "That's like, super, super creepy, you know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6328"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6340"
msgid ""
"Ohmigod, you have to hear this! One of my old pictures got put in a "
"magazine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6352"
msgid "Oh, really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6364"
msgid ""
"Yeah! There was this special titled \"Para Para: A Look Back\" or something "
"like that, and they put in a picture of me at a Para Para event!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6376"
msgid "Oh man, I was so frickin' tan back then! Like, it was obscene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6388"
msgid "You did Para Para back in the day?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6400"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I was a total Paralist! I danced to Para Para music and techno at all "
"these events at big name clubs..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6412"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6424"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I was like, 16, too, hanging out with 22, 23-year-old college "
"students... I was even the first chair of this special event thing, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6436"
msgid "That's impressive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6448"
msgid ""
"I dunno, I don't think so. Like, I just did the stuff I always did, and "
"everything just ended up that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6460"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6472"
msgid ""
"Like, I get super annoyed when stuff doesn't get done, so I just go out and "
"do it instead. That's how I ended up in that position."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6484"
msgid "Makes sense..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6496"
msgid "You don't do Para Para any more?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6508"
msgid ""
"I mean, nobody really does it anymore, and I hang out with a totally "
"different crowd now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6520"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6532"
msgid "I always hung out with people older than me, even back then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6544"
msgid "I had a really hard time making friends with, like, people my own age."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6556"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6568"
msgid "Man, though... I had, like, so much fun back then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6580"
msgid "How old are you again? You're reminiscing like an old lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6592"
msgid "Hahaha! ♪ Okay, I get that. I'm only 21!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6604"
msgid "Not that old of a lady, then, heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6616"
msgid "What did that \"chair\" job entail?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6628"
msgid "Hahaha! ♪ Ohmigod, wait, really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6640"
msgid "I didn't think you'd actually ask me about that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6652"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6664"
msgid ""
"It wasn't really like a super serious job, I just said what I wanted to, "
"and made people follow me and stuff. It wasn't a huge deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6676"
msgid "Was that it...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6688"
msgid "Yeah. I was kinda like their leader."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6700"
msgid "Huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6712"
msgid ""
"Hey, Kiryu-san, I think I might've, like, really pissed off one of my "
"friends when we went out to eat the other day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6724"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6736"
msgid ""
"She was taking like, forever to figure out what she wanted to order, and "
"kept going back and forth on stuff, so I just went ahead and ordered for "
"her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6748"
msgid ""
"She got like, super pissed at me, and started yelling at me, like, \"Let me "
"choose what I wanna eat, okay!?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6760"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6772"
msgid "She hasn't called me at all since that happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6784"
msgid "That is kind of crossing the line."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6796"
msgid ""
"Really? Come on, I mean, who wouldn't get annoyed when someone's wasting "
"your time like that over nothing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6808"
msgid "It's still probably going too far."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6820"
msgid "...You really think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6832"
msgid "You're two different people. Everyone moves at their own pace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6844"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6856"
msgid "You need to be a little more patient."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6868"
msgid "How long was she taking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6880"
msgid ""
"I mean, she wasn't taking that long. I just got super annoyed with waiting "
"for her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6892"
msgid "That's why you ordered for her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6904"
msgid "But like, isn't it way easier for everyone if I just do it for her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6916"
msgid "Is that how it works?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6928"
msgid ""
"No, but I did it for her, you know? I wasn't trying to be a bitch or "
"anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6940"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6952"
msgid "You don't feel bad about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6964"
msgid "I mean, I did it to help her, you know...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6976"
msgid "...Okay, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6988"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7000"
msgid "...You're still worried about it though, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7012"
msgid "...Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7024"
msgid ""
"So, maybe she does things at her own pace. Maybe you should've been a "
"little more patient."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7036"
msgid "Yeah... Maybe I should send her an email..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7048"
msgid "Good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7060"
msgid ""
"Sorry to bother you with this super weird issue. I'm kinda glad I vented to "
"you, though. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7072"
msgid "Heh, glad to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7084"
msgid "Ugh, I wanna go to an onsen so frickin' bad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7096"
msgid "...What's the matter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7108"
msgid "Nothing, just, like, I've been kinda on edge lately, hahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7120"
msgid "Just a lot of things frustrating you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7132"
msgid "Yeah. It's waaay too much to handle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7144"
msgid "Aww."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7156"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, like, I just wanna get out of here, you know? Just run away to "
"some place that's totally not here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7168"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7180"
msgid "I mean, I looove going out and partying with tons of people..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7192"
msgid ""
"And maybe the clubs can get like, a little loud sometimes, but that's not "
"why I wanna leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7204"
msgid "I think it's, like, all the crowds and the noise and stuff in the city..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7216"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7228"
msgid "So maybe I'll just get on some random train and go to a fancy onsen.."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7240"
msgid "Go, relax."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7252"
msgid "Ugh, I sooo want to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7264"
msgid "Going to an onsen is nice, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7276"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7288"
msgid "Hehehe. You're always so funny, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7300"
msgid "Huh? Wait, that was funny?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7312"
msgid "Yeah, like, you sounded so serious about it. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7324"
msgid "Heh, did I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7336"
msgid "Do you have the time to do that right now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7348"
msgid "I dunno..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7360"
msgid "But, like, if I don't get some time off, I feel like..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7372"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7384"
msgid "Nothing, just..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7396"
msgid "I had this thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7408"
msgid "Like, I'd use that time to figure out all my thoughts, you know? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7420"
msgid "Not a bad idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7432"
msgid "Maybe I'll go with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7444"
msgid "Hahaha! Ohmigosh, you're sooo hilarious! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7456"
msgid "Heh. I wasn't kidding, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7468"
msgid ""
"Wow. You're like, pretty straightforward about that kind of stuff, huh, "
"Kiryu-san? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7480"
msgid "Are you saying that's a bad thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7492"
msgid ""
"Not at all! It's just... I dunno. You're kind of shy, too. Ahh, you're so "
"complicated! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7504"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7516"
msgid "Ugh, another one of my friends is pissed at me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7528"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7540"
msgid ""
"So like, I was at this friend's house, and I threw out a bunch of stuff. "
"Now she practically wants to kill me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7552"
msgid "Let me guess. You threw out her things without telling her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7564"
msgid "Well, yeah, but for good reasons, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7576"
msgid "Like..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7588"
msgid ""
"She had this pumice stone in her shower that was all moldy, and this old, "
"gross hairbrush..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7600"
msgid ""
"Oh, and her toothbrush was all old and beaten up! It was probably like, two "
"years old!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7612"
msgid "It was all stuff that belonged in the trash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7624"
msgid "Yeah, those are all disgusting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7636"
msgid "I know, right? I mean, that's why I threw them in the garbage!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7648"
msgid "Did you really need to go that far, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7660"
msgid "Oh, come on, they were soooo gross."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7672"
msgid "But they weren't yours to throw away, were they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7684"
msgid ""
"So, what, I should get yelled at because I did something nice for a gross "
"friend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7696"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7708"
msgid "She might not have thought it was very nice of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7720"
msgid "...I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7732"
msgid "What am I supposed to do about it now, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7744"
msgid "That's up to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7756"
msgid "But why didn't you tell her you threw them out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7768"
msgid ""
"Why should I have to? I mean, like, if you saw trash on your friend's "
"floor, you'd throw it away, right? You wouldn't tell them to do it, would "
"you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7780"
msgid "Were those things lying around her floor, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7792"
msgid "Well, no..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7804"
msgid "They might have been gross, and certainly needed to be thrown out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7816"
msgid "But maybe she was going to dispose of them on her own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7828"
msgid "I guess..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7840"
msgid "What am I supposed to do about it now, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7852"
msgid "That's up to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7864"
msgid "Maybe they were special to her in some way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7876"
msgid "No way, they were all super gross."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7888"
msgid "That may be, but how do you know she wanted them thrown away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7900"
msgid "Well... I didn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7912"
msgid ""
"Look, I know you had good intentions, but you still shouldn't have done "
"that without asking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7924"
msgid "Guess I should go apologize to her..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7936"
msgid "Probably."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7948"
msgid "Fine, I'll apologize, but I'm gonna tell her why I threw them out too, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7960"
msgid "Heh, that's perfectly fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7972"
msgid "Uggggh, seriously though! This is soooo dumb..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7984"
msgid "You've still gotta do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7996"
msgid "Yeah... I know... And I think I learned a little something, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8008"
msgid "That's good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8020"
msgid "Ohmigosh, ohmigosh, ohmigosh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8032"
msgid "What? Is everything okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8044"
msgid "It's more than okay! I've almost saved up enough money to go on my trip!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8056"
msgid "That's great."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8068"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ Oh, man, what I am gonna, like, do with myself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8080"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8092"
msgid ""
"I mean, like, now that I have all that money in my bank account, I'm "
"starting to feel, like, way different..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8104"
msgid "Like, ohmigosh, it's actually happening, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8116"
msgid "Makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8128"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8140"
msgid "Getting nervous?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8152"
msgid "Maybe a little..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8164"
msgid "Heh, I can only imagine why."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8176"
msgid "I kinda don't know what to do about it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8188"
msgid "Prepare yourself for the battle ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8200"
msgid "What battle? You're hilarious, Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8212"
msgid "...Man, I can't even laugh... I must be pretty nervous, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8224"
msgid "You sure sound like it. Hang in there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8236"
msgid "All that planning must be tough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8248"
msgid "Yeah... There's, like, so much I gotta do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8260"
msgid "Such as?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8272"
msgid "I mean, I do have a study abroad agency making all the big plans for me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8284"
msgid "I just don't know what I should bring with me, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8296"
msgid "You could pack light. Bring only what you need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8308"
msgid ""
"Oooh, that sounds good! Plus, I could get a whole bunch of fun stuff over "
"there instead!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8320"
msgid "See, that works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8332"
msgid "...Thanks, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8344"
msgid "What for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8356"
msgid ""
"I feel sooo much better after talking it over with you. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8368"
msgid "Heh, well, good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8380"
msgid "I'll miss you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8392"
msgid "Me too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8404"
msgid "It's gonna suck, moving away from all my friends...  And you, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8416"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8428"
msgid "But I've gotta go, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8440"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8452"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san, can I ask you a super weird question?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8464"
msgid "Sure, go for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8476"
msgid "Like, have you ever like, really wanted to cry, but totally couldn't?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8488"
msgid "...I'm not sure, to be honest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8500"
msgid ""
"I don't know what's up with me, like... Sometimes, I'm like right there, "
"right on the verge of tears, but I just can't do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8512"
msgid "Maybe I'm afraid of letting all those feelings out or something..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8524"
msgid "You don't have to hold back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8536"
msgid "I know... I just, maybe I don't want to be honest with myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8548"
msgid "It's possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8560"
msgid "But maybe you're just worrying too much about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8572"
msgid "...I guess I might be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8584"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8596"
msgid "Don't think so hard about it. Just let the tears flow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8608"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8620"
msgid "Tears will come out on their own, when the time is right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8632"
msgid "...So, what, are you saying I'm like, forcing myself to cry?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8644"
msgid "That's a possibility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8656"
msgid ""
"Huh... Maybe you're right. It's not like there are any rules about when or "
"where you should cry, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8668"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8680"
msgid "...Thanks, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8692"
msgid "No problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8704"
msgid "Are you forcing yourself to cry?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8716"
msgid "...Like, making myself cry on purpose?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8728"
msgid "Well, I'm not sure, but you said you wanted to cry, so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8740"
msgid "No, it's not like that, geez."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8752"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8764"
msgid ""
"Hey, I know this is a random question, buuut, do you like it when girls "
"fawn on you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8776"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8788"
msgid "Uhh, well, I'm like, pretty terrible at being all affectionate like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8800"
msgid "Oh, really? Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8812"
msgid "Hey! What, you think it's like, funny, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8824"
msgid "Just a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8836"
msgid "Ugh, this was like, the one thing I didn't want to happen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8848"
msgid "Hahaha. You were saying?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8860"
msgid ""
"...So, like, for me, there's gotta be something I respect about a guy for "
"me to fall for him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8872"
msgid ""
"Wait, no, it's more like, I only end up falling for guys that I really "
"respect..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8884"
msgid "I think I get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8896"
msgid "I always end up pushing myself real hard in front of those kinds of guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8908"
msgid "Like, maybe I don't want to disappoint them or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8920"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8932"
msgid "Anyway, so like, I have a super hard time loving on guys I respect..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8944"
msgid "What's wrong with that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8956"
msgid "You sure it's not a problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8968"
msgid "I mean, that's just who you are, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8980"
msgid "...Well, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8992"
msgid "You're right, but, you know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9004"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9016"
msgid "Why don't you tell them about it, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9028"
msgid ""
"Wait, seriously? But wouldn't dudes be, like, totally weirded out about "
"that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9040"
msgid "Would you be weirded out about it if a guy said that to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9052"
msgid ""
"Oh, huh... I get it. So maybe I shouldn't be super worried about it then, "
"huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9064"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9076"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9088"
msgid "Well, that was easy, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9100"
msgid "What's wrong with easy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9112"
msgid ""
"Aw, man, like, what's even up with me today? Thanks, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9124"
msgid "Heh, no problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9136"
msgid "You don't have to force yourself. Just be the way you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9148"
msgid "...You know, when you put it that way, maybe I was, like, forcing myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9160"
msgid "I can't say I'm an expert on this sort of thing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9172"
msgid ""
"But I think that whenever you feel worried or stressed, you're likely "
"forcing yourself to do something you dislike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9184"
msgid "...Huh, okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9196"
msgid "I mean, I think you're right. I just gotta think about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9208"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9220"
msgid "Ohmigosh, Kiryu-san, I need you to chime in on this for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9232"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9244"
msgid ""
"So like, what do you think about girls that blow up a guy's phone after he "
"breaks up with her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9256"
msgid "Wait, blow up as in explode?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9268"
msgid ""
"No, like... When a girl keeps texting and calling over and over, until you "
"finally tell her to lay off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9280"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9292"
msgid "Hahaha! ♪ You're taking this like, so seriously! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9304"
msgid "The whole reason I bring it up is because I am totally that kind of girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9316"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9328"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Like, even after they break up with me, I feel like we've still got "
"this connection between us, and I can't give up on them like that, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9340"
msgid "Hmm... I can see that, I suppose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9352"
msgid "My friends used to give me so much crap about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9364"
msgid ""
"Like, \"Dude, that's kind of pathetic. Can't you take a hint? Leave him "
"alone!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9376"
msgid ""
"They don't complain about it anymore, though. They're just like, \"Well, "
"that's Ranko for you.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9388"
msgid "Uh-huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9400"
msgid "What do you think about it, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9412"
msgid "You should probably leave them alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9424"
msgid ""
"What? But, like, how am I supposed to do that when I'm still super in love "
"with them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9436"
msgid "Well, I guess that makes sense..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9448"
msgid "Uhhh, you're being super confusing. Which is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9460"
msgid "You should definitely leave them alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9472"
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9484"
msgid "There are plenty of other fish in the sea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9496"
msgid "Hehe! ♪ I guess that's true!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9508"
msgid "But you and I are pretty different, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9520"
msgid "...I suppose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9532"
msgid "I suppose it's not a problem, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9544"
msgid "Wait, what? Hold on..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9556"
msgid "Kiryu-san, can you, like, make up your mind? Seriously..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9568"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9580"
msgid "I'm not really sure..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9592"
msgid ""
"What? But, like, how am I supposed to leave them alone when I'm still super "
"in love with them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9604"
msgid "I can understand that, I suppose..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9616"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9628"
msgid "I know how I'd feel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9640"
msgid "I'd be pretty worried about her, seeing as I'd still have feelings for her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9652"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9664"
msgid "But contacting her like that might make her unhappy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9676"
msgid "Kiryu-san, you're super cool, you know that? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9688"
msgid "Heh, thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9700"
msgid ""
"I guess I've still got some growing up to do, huh? But that's pretty "
"obvious. I'm like, barely out of my teens!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9712"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9724"
msgid "I guess it depends on the time and situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9736"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9748"
msgid "Contacting him like that might end up hurting him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9760"
msgid "Maybe... I guess you're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9772"
msgid "You don't have to give up. Just don't make it harder for the poor guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9784"
msgid "Kiryu-san, you're super cool, you know that? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9796"
msgid "Heh, thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9808"
msgid ""
"I guess I've still got some growing up to do, huh? But that's pretty "
"obvious. I'm like, barely out of my teens!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9820"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9832"
msgid ""
"So the other night, my friend stayed over, but like, when I went to make "
"dinner for her, she got all weirded out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9844"
msgid "Why? What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9856"
msgid "Like, she was totally not into what I made."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9868"
msgid "What'd you make?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9880"
msgid "Just buttered squid natto!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9892"
msgid "Buttered... squid... natto?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9904"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Like, you mix up a raw egg with the natto, then add some squid and "
"green onions, and top it off with some butter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9916"
msgid "...Wow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9928"
msgid "Ohmigosh, your reactions are always, like, so hilarious! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9940"
msgid "I'm trying to cook more like my mom, so I came up with that little recipe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9952"
msgid "Sounds delicious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9964"
msgid "It is! At least, I think it's pretty good."
msgstr ""

